CONTEXT Shop INCLUDES Catalogue FROM "../contexts/with_variable.adl" [ "Strict" ] AS Cat
CONTEXT Shop IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Shop
{+ An inclusion statement can set preprocessor variables for the included file.
With the variable `Strict`, the catalogue comes with its rule `priced`, to which this context refers.
Without the variable that rule would not exist, and the reference would be an error. +}

RELATION stock[Cat.Product*Quantity] [UNI]

ROLE Buyer MAINTAINS Cat.priced

ENDCONTEXT
